  "Name": "X360 VideoPlayer ActiveX Control Buffer Overflow",
  "Description": "This module exploits a buffer overflow in the VideoPlayer.ocx ActiveX installed with the X360 Software. By setting an overly long value to 'ConvertFile()', an attacker can overrun a .data buffer to bypass ASLR/DEP and finally execute arbitrary code.",
